    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not a lie though. i can see it in their faces. if i stay and just keep failing and failing, i'm just going to drag them down with me forever. i'd rather they remember the version of me that actually made them proud, instead of watching me slowly rot into someone they don't even recognize. wouldn't it just be easier if things just... stopped while i still have some dignity left?",
